"\n"
"Paymob redirects to a payment page with possibility to simulate payments and select different\n"
"possible outcomes after filling the information required based on selected payment method.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_razorpay
msgid ""
"# Razorpay\n"
"\n"
"## Technical details\n"
"\n"
"API: [Recurring Payments API](https://razorpay.com/docs/api/payments/recurring-payments/)\n"
