#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_marin
msgid ""
"=====\n"
"Marin\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"AgroMarin's central installer module. Extends and customizes nearly every\n"
"functional area of Odoo for a Mexican agricultural company: accounting\n"
"(MX EDI/CFDI), sales, purchasing, inventory (reconditioning, productivity\n"
"tracking, granular permissions), manufacturing, POS, HR/payroll, partner\n"
"profiling/scoring, project management, and document management.\n"
"\n"
"See ``oca_dependencies.txt`` for required repositories.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Subsystem Overview\n"
"==================\n"
"\n"
"The module is organized in 8 interconnected subsystems that extend Odoo's\n"
"core functional areas:\n"
"\n"
".. code-block:: text\n"
"\n"
"                             ┌─────────────────────────────┐\n"
"                             │      PARTNER PROFILING       │\n"
"                             │ res.partner (extended)       │\n"
"                             │ res.partner.age.range        │\n"
"                             │ res.partner.tag (ext)   │\n"
"                             │ scoring -> agro_profile      │\n"
"                             └──────┬──────────────┬────────┘\n"
"                                    │              │\n"
"               ┌────────────────────▼──┐    ┌──────▼──────────────────┐\n"
"               │    SALES & TARGETS    │    │   PURCHASE CATEGORIES   │\n"
"               │ sale.order (ext)      │    │ purchase.order (ext)    │\n"
"               │ sale.target(.line)    │    │ 4 vendor category groups│\n"
"               │ sale.order.template   │    │ approval categories     │\n"
"               │ season_id (date.range)│    └─────────────────────────┘\n"
"               └────────┬──────────────┘\n"
"                        │\n"
"    ┌───────────────────▼───────────────────┐   ┌──────────────────────────────┐\n"
"    │       WAREHOUSE & PRODUCTIVITY         │   │    MX LOCALIZATION (EDI)     │\n"
"    │ stock.picking (ext, 52 methods)        │   │ account.move (ext)           │\n"
"    │ stock.picking.type (8 user M2M)        │   │ account.move.line (ext)      │\n"
"    │ stock.move / stock.move.line (ext)     │   │ l10n_mx_edi.document (ext)   │\n"
"    │ stock.location (distance calc)         │   │ x_treatment fiscal flag      │\n"
"    │ stock.quant (custom removal)           │   │ SAT status + cancel alerts   │\n"
"    │ V1-V5 time windows                     │   │ PUE/PPD payment policy       │\n"
"    │ Zigzag / Circuit methods               │   │ BBVA bank import             │\n"
"    └───────────┬────────────────────────────┘   └──────────────────────────────┘\n"
"                │\n"
"    ┌───────────▼───────────────────┐   ┌──────────────────────────────────┐\n"
"    │    PRODUCT RECONDITIONING     │   │         POS CASH MGMT            │\n"
"    │ stock.lot (parent/child)      │   │ pos.session (ext)                │\n"
"    │ stock.quant (eligibility)     │   │ pos.config (ext)                 │\n"
"    │ stock.reconditioning.wizard   │   │ pos.order / pos.order.line (ext) │\n"
"    │ mrp.bom (reformulated type)   │   │ pos.cash.transfer.wizard         │\n"
"    │ mrp.production (auto-created) │   │ account.move (pos_session link)  │\n"
"    │ stock.warehouse (allow flag)  │   └──────────────────────────────────┘\n"
"    └───────────────────────────────┘\n"
"                                        ┌──────────────────────────────────┐\n"
"                                        │         HR & PAYROLL             │\n"
"                                        │ hr.employee (MX type, POS flag)  │\n"
"                                        │ hr.payslip / hr.payslip.run      │\n"
"                                        │ hr.version (SDI, seniority)      │\n"
"                                        │ hr.job (job rank)                │\n"
"                                        └──────────────────────────────────┘\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Partner Profiling\n"
"=================\n"
"\n"
"Customer scoring was extracted from ``marin`` into the dedicated\n"
"``agro_profile`` module (t22384, transitional rewrite). ``marin`` no longer\n"
"computes scores or profiles and no longer owns ``res.partner.hectares.range``\n"
"or ``res.partner.profile.history``; the ``res.partner.profile`` bucket was\n"
"renamed to ``agro.profile``. ``marin`` now only *consumes* the result through\n"
"``partner.agro_profile_id`` (e.g. ``sale.target``).\n"
"\n"
"The scoring engine — UI-configurable weights over agro surfaces and EAV\n"
"attributes, percentage normalization, and a per-dimension audit trail\n"
"(``agro.profile.score``) — lives in ``agro_profile``. See that module for the\n"
"current compute chain and the migration away from the legacy tag-based engine.\n"
"\n"
"Age chain::\n"
"\n"
"    birthdate ──→ _compute_age ──→ age ──→ _compute_age_range_id ──→ age_range_id\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Warehouse Productivity\n"
"======================\n"
"\n"
"Measures operator efficiency during picking by comparing theoretical vs.\n"
"actual completion times. Lifecycle::\n"
"\n"
"    1. Picking confirmed/assigned\n"
"    2. action_operator_checkin()\n"
"       ├── Opens stock.picking.assign.wizard (supervisor validates)\n"
"       └── Sets operator_check_in = now()\n"
"    3. action_calculate_theoretical_times()\n"
"       ├── Reads config params (buffer, speed, seconds_per_unit)\n"
"       ├── For each move_line, calculates 5 time windows:\n"
"       │   ├── V1: Travel to pick location + buffer (first line only)\n"
"       │   ├── V2: Ascent to rack level (uses posz from stock_threed)\n"
"       │   ├── V3: Picking time (base_time * quantity)\n"
"       │   ├── V4: Descent with product\n"
"       │   └── V5: Travel to destination + buffer (last line only)\n"
"       └── Two methods:\n"
"           ├── zigzag: sequential line-by-line\n"
"           └── circuit: nearest-neighbor by XY coords\n"
"    4. action_operator_checkout()\n"
"       └── Triggers _compute_productivity_metrics\n"
"           ├── productivity_percentage = real / theoretical * 100\n"
"           └── efficiency_rating:\n"
"               ├── excellent (>= 120%)   ├── good (100-119%)\n"
"               └── average (80-99%)      └── poor (< 80%)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Product Reconditioning\n"
"======================\n"
"\n"
"Extends shelf life by creating a new lot from an existing one via MO::\n"
"\n"
"    stock.quant (can_be_reconditioned=True)\n"
"        └── action_open_reconditioning_wizard()\n"
"            └── stock.reconditioning.wizard\n"
"                ├── Validates: group, quant, warehouse flag, mrp access\n"
"                ├── _get_or_create_bom()  [production_type='reformulated']\n"
"                ├── _get_or_create_lot()  [new or reuse, parent_lot_id link]\n"
"                └── _create_manufacturing_order(bom, new_lot)\n"
"                    ├── Consume parent lot (manual component move)\n"
"                    ├── Produce new lot (manual finished move)\n"
"                    └── Force MO to state='done'\n"
"\n"
"Lot chain (self-referential)::\n"
"\n"
"    Original Lot A (parent_lot_id = False)\n"
"        └── Reconditioned Lot A-R1 (parent_lot_id = A)\n"
"            └── Re-reconditioned Lot A-R2 (parent_lot_id = A-R1)\n"
"\n"
"``_get_root_lot()`` walks up recursively. ``_check_parent_lot_cycle()``\n"
"validates no circular references.\n"
"\n"
"Custom removal strategy: when no strategy is defined on category or\n"
"location, default is ``refurbished + fefo + priority`` — order by\n"
"``original_expiration_date ASC, removal_date ASC, removal_priority ASC,\n"
"id``. Prioritizes reconditioned products (shorter original expiration)\n"
"first.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"MX Localization (CFDI/EDI)\n"
"==========================\n"
"\n"
"Fiscal treatment (``account.journal.x_treatment``):\n"
"\n"
"============================= =========================== =============\n"
"Value                         Meaning                     CFDI Required\n"
"============================= =========================== =============\n"
"``fiscal_real``               Real fiscal operations      Yes\n"
"``fiscal_simulated``          Simulated fiscal (testing)  Yes\n"
"``not_fiscal_real``           Non-fiscal real             No\n"
"``not_fiscal_simulated``      Non-fiscal simulated        No\n"
"============================= =========================== =============\n"
"\n"
"Key overrides:\n"
"\n"
"- ``_compute_l10n_mx_edi_is_cfdi_needed``: checks ``x_treatment`` instead\n"
"  of blanket MX check\n"
"- ``create()``: strips taxes from non-fiscal moves\n"
"- ``_compute_show_send_button``: hides Send for non-fiscal\n"
"\n"
"PUE/PPD payment policy — default PUE; PPD if due date crosses month/year\n"
"boundary AND not ``cfdi_to_public`` AND not ``force_payment_policy_pue``.\n"
"\n"
"SAT status monitoring: ``l10n_mx_edi.document._fetch_and_update_sat_status``\n"
"processes documents in batches ordered by ``last_sat_state_sync_date``,\n"
"commits per-document, propagates network errors for retry. Transitions\n"
"from ``valid`` to ``cancelled`` post a message to the Discuss channel\n"
"``sat_status_cancellation_channel``. ``EstadoCancelacion`` parsing:\n"
"``Estado=Vigente`` with non-empty ``EstadoCancelacion`` is treated as\n"
"pending-cancellation.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Security Model\n"
"==============\n"
"\n"
"Custom privilege categories:\n"
"\n"
"=============== ==================================================== ==========\n"
"Category        Privileges                                           Count\n"
"=============== ==================================================== ==========\n"
"Accounting      Vendor/Customer Docs, Journal Entry (3-tier), Bank   6\n"
"                Statements, Cash Discount, Credit Limit\n"
"Master Data     Product Cost (readonly/manager)                      1\n"
"Vendors         Xiuman, Potatoes, General, Core Business             4\n"
"Supply Chain    Inventory Adj, Reconditioning, Printing (user/mgr),  4\n"
"                PO Lock\n"
"Sales           Liquidity Transfer, SO Lock                          2\n"
"Services        Project KPIs                                         1\n"
"Assets          Fleet, Equipment, Property, Machinery, Tools, IT     6\n"
"=============== ==================================================== ==========\n"
"\n"
"Hierarchical groups (``<`` means \"implies\"):\n"
"\n"
"- **Journal Entry:** ``group_account_move_draft`` < ``group_account_move_cancel`` < ``group_account_move_force_removal``\n"
"- **Product Cost:** ``group_product_cost_readonly`` < ``group_product_cost_manager``\n"
"- **Stock Printing:** ``group_stock_print_user`` < ``group_stock_print_manager``\n"
"- **POS:** ``group_pos_user`` < ``group_pos_officer`` < ``group_pos_manager``\n"
"\n"
"Granular stock permissions — ``stock.picking.type`` has 8 Many2many\n"
"fields linking users to actions (``can_todo_user_ids``,\n"
"``can_validate_user_ids``, ``can_check_availability_user_ids``,\n"
"``can_unreserve_user_ids``, ``can_scrap_user_ids``,\n"
"``can_return_user_ids``, ``can_open_detailed_operations_user_ids``,\n"
"``user_can_access_ids``). Empty list = no restriction.\n"
"``stock.group_stock_manager`` bypasses all granular checks.\n"
"\n"
"Record rules — only 4 defined in marin:\n"
"``sales_master_report_rule_manager/salesperson``,\n"
"``approval_request_sale_readonly_rule``,\n"
"``sales_master_report_sale_readonly_rule``.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Naming Patterns\n"
"===============\n"
"\n"
"=================================== ======================================== ================================\n"
"Pattern                             Example                                  Rule\n"
"=================================== ======================================== ================================\n"
"Security group XML ID               ``group_account_debt_manager``           ``group_{area}_{role}``\n"
"Privilege XML ID                    ``privilege_credit_limit``               ``privilege_{feature}``\n"
"User permission M2M                 ``can_validate_user_ids``                ``can_{action}_user_ids`` on\n"
"                                                                             ``stock.picking.type``\n"
"Show boolean                        ``show_validate``                        ``show_{action}`` on\n"
"                                                                             ``stock.picking``\n"
"User group boolean                  ``user_sale_manager``                    ``user_{group_name}`` computed\n"
"Score field                         ``score_hectares``                       ``score_{dimension}``\n"
"Force flag                          ``force_fully_invoiced``                 ``force_{state_name}``\n"
"Fiscal treatment                    ``x_treatment``                          ``x_`` prefix for non-standard\n"
"                                                                             accounting fields\n"
"Approval category ref               ``approval_category_1001``               ``approval_category_{seq_id}``\n"
"Cron XML ID                         ``ir_cron_merge_inactive_customers``     ``ir_cron_{action}``\n"
"=================================== ======================================== ================================\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Config Parameters (ir.config_parameter)\n"
"=======================================\n"
"\n"
"============================================================= ========= ========================================\n"
"Key                                                           Default   Used By\n"
"============================================================= ========= ========================================\n"
"``warehouse.theoretical_seconds_per_unit``                    60.0      Productivity metrics\n"
"``warehouse.productivity_buffer_time``                        30.0      Theoretical time calc\n"
"``warehouse.productivity_travel_speed``                       1.4       Distance/time (m/s)\n"
"``warehouse.productivity_checkin_location_id``                -         Default check-in location\n"
"``warehouse.productivity_default_location_dest_id``           -         Default destination (V5 calc)\n"
"``warehouse.default_ascent_time_per_level``                   5.0       V2 time window\n"
"``warehouse.default_descent_time_per_level``                  3.0       V4 time window\n"
"``warehouse_productivity.picking_seconds_per_unit``           30.0      V3 time window\n"
"``customer_merge_active``                                     False     Enable customer merge cron\n"
"``customer_merge_general_partner_id``                         0         Merge target partner\n"
"``customer_merge_min_orders``                                 2         Min orders to avoid merge\n"
"``customer_merge_interval_number`` / ``_interval_type``       3/months  Evaluation period\n"
"``document_l10n_mx_edi.sat_batch_size``                       100       SAT status check batch size\n"
"``document_l10n_mx_edi.sat_status_max_days``                  60        Max age for SAT status checks\n"
"============================================================= ========= ========================================\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Common Gotchas\n"
"==============\n"
"\n"
"1. **``stock.picking.read()`` auto-assigns user.** When productivity\n"
"   tracking is enabled and no user is set, ``read()`` assigns\n"
"   ``self.env.user`` to ``picking.user_id`` — reading modifies. Beware\n"
"   in batch operations and reports.\n"
"\n"
"2. **``sudo()`` sites** — customer merge cron, credit warning\n"
"   computation, sale order cancel (stock.move ACL), picking validate\n"
"   (sale access), GL dashboard data, SAT status fetch. Restricted\n"
"   contact editing moved to a whitelist mechanism\n"
"   (``partner_group_restricted``) — see that module's README.\n"
"\n"
"3. **Granular permissions are additive to manager.**\n"
"   ``stock.group_stock_manager`` bypasses ALL granular checks; the\n"
"   ``can_*_user_ids`` fields only gate non-manager users.\n"
"\n"
"5. **Custom removal default.** When no strategy is set on category or\n"
"   location, marin defaults to ``refurbished + fefo + priority``\n"
"   (not stock's default FIFO).\n"
